# Recommended Design

## Identity Layer

### Microsoft Entra ID

Provides:

- User accounts
- Authentication
- Conditional Access
- MFA

### Apple School Manager / Apple Business Manager

Provides:

- Managed Apple IDs
- Device assignment
- Automated Device Enrollment

Shared iPad works best when Apple School Manager or Apple Business Manager is federated with Microsoft Entra ID. Users then sign in to Shared iPads using their Entra credentials.

