# Enrollment Profile Configuration

In Intune, go to:

```text
Devices
└── iOS/iPadOS
    └── Enrollment
        └── Apple Enrollment Tokens
```

## Enrollment Profile Settings

| Setting | Recommended Value |
|---|---|
| User Affinity | No |
| Supervised | Yes |
| Shared iPad | Yes |
| Locked Enrollment | Recommended |
| Company Portal | Not required |
| Setup Assistant | Modern Authentication |

> **Important:** Shared iPad should use enrollment without user affinity.

