# Storage Architecture

Shared iPad creates local user partitions.

```text
iPad Storage
│
├── System Partition
│
├── User 1
├── User 2
├── User 3
└── Temporary Sessions
```

Each user receives dedicated storage.

The number of profiles available is based on:

- Total storage
- Configured cache settings
- Session design

