# Recommended Frontline Work Scenario

If the customer is not education and only needs shift-based access, consider:

```text
Shared Device Mode
```

instead of:

```text
Shared iPad
```

Shared Device Mode is often preferred for:

- Retail
- Healthcare
- Manufacturing
- Flight crews

Shared Device Mode focuses on quick sign-in and sign-out rather than persistent local profiles.

---

# Shared iPad vs Shared Device Mode

| Category | Shared iPad | Shared Device Mode |
|---|---|---|
| Primary use case | Education, labs, persistent shared user profiles | Frontline worker, shift-based access |
| Supported devices | iPad | iPhone, iPod touch, iPad |
| User data model | Local user partitions | App-based shared sign-in/sign-out |
| Microsoft Entra federation with Apple required | Yes | No |
| Managed Apple ID required | Yes | No |
| Temporary session support | Yes | Not applicable |
| App model | Device-licensed VPP apps, LOB apps, web apps | Apps that support Shared Device Mode |
| Best fit | Students or users needing a persistent profile | Workers needing fast shared device turnover |

