# Troubleshooting Flow

Use this flow when Shared iPads do not enroll correctly, users cannot sign in, or apps do not deploy as expected.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Shared iPad issue reported] --> B{Device assigned to Intune MDM server in ASM or ABM?}
    B -- No --> B1[Assign device to Intune MDM server and sync token]
    B -- Yes --> C{ADE token active in Intune?}
    C -- No --> C1[Renew or reconnect ADE token]
    C -- Yes --> D{Apple MDM Push Certificate active?}
    D -- No --> D1[Renew APNs certificate]
    D -- Yes --> E{Enrollment profile assigned?}
    E -- No --> E1[Assign Shared iPad enrollment profile]
    E -- Yes --> F{Supervised mode enabled?}
    F -- No --> F1[Enable supervision in enrollment profile]
    F -- Yes --> G{User affinity disabled?}
    G -- No --> G1[Set enrollment profile to enroll without user affinity]
    G -- Yes --> H{Shared iPad enabled?}
    H -- No --> H1[Enable Shared iPad in enrollment profile]
    H -- Yes --> I{Federation configured?}
    I -- No --> I1[Configure federation or manually create Managed Apple IDs]
    I -- Yes --> J{Apps assigned as device-licensed required apps?}
    J -- No --> J1[Assign VPP apps with device licensing]
    J -- Yes --> K[Validate sign-in, app install, and user partition behavior]
```

