# Reference Architecture Recommendation

For most K-12 and higher education customers:

```text
Shared iPad
+
Apple School Manager federation
+
Microsoft Entra ID
+
Microsoft Intune
```

is the recommended reference architecture.

For frontline worker scenarios, evaluate whether:

```text
Microsoft Entra Shared Device Mode
```

provides a simpler operational model before choosing Shared iPad.

